<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Milceni</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Milceni were a West Slavic tribe living around <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bautzen">Bautzen</a> in what is now <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/upper-lusatia">Upper Lusatia</a>, in eastern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/germany">Germany</a>. Their land, called Milsko, was conquered by the Germans in the 10th century and later contested between <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/poland">Poland</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/meissen">Meissen</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bohemia">Bohemia</a>. Together with the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lusici">Lusici</a> they are ancestors of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sorbs">Sorbs</a>.</p></div>
